  "details": "I've noticed that the value of booping was de-synced from my user's value.\n\nWhen seeing my user's value for isBoopingEnabled value was set to false, despite my client having the value for Send and Receive Boops being True, setting the value from True to False, then back to True, synced it up again.\n\nWhen this desync was happening, when I was trying to boop in game, I was getting the UI message \"[player] is currently not receiving boops\" (wording perhaps mixed around), which is obviously the wrong message when my booping is disabled.",
